Z||000000||Haze_Performance||11-11-2000||07:29 AM||||<B>I drove my Fiero to the Bank the other day ( good now its a Fiero topic    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )  I went to the ATM and withdrew $2000. Well thinking everything was ok I proceeded home. The next day I hear on the news that there was withdraw problems at that machine. I returned to the Bank and demanded a recount of my money. It took 24 hours to do so because they told me they would have to do it by hand. Well the count came back the following evening. They said I received $1879. They said that there would have to be another recount. So I contacted a lawyer (Mr. Rep)and he went down there to keep an eye on the recount They told me that they also will have there lawyers present to keep it fair. Well yesterday morning I received a disturbing phone call. Its now a possibility that the ATM in question has a confusing key pad layout. After the call I immediately went back to the bank. I pulled up in the parking lot and to my surprise there was a crowd of people picketing. The signs they were carrying read "WE DEMAND A RE-WITHDRAW". I couldn't believe it. I thought to myself.. I was smart enough to hit the right buttons how come you weren't? Well I proceeded into the bank. I was greeted by my lawyer Mr. Rep he told me that the banks lawyer Mr. Dem demaned yet another recount. But the good news is that im up to $1968. Now Im still waiting.. Theres also some talk about overseas money that may come into play here... I was told it may go on as long as next month.... Have you ever heard of such a thing??<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>FLAME SUIT ON    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlogo1_1.gif">     <BR><B>"AHHHHH!!! All Fiero's don't start on fire you BONEHEAD!!"</B><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 11-11-20